  "source": "Example numbers (maan lo), before GST: ₹300 + ₹25 + ₹70 + ₹12 + ₹40 + ₹200 = ₹647 per order; ₹599 − ₹647 = −₹48; ₹647 + ₹150 profit = ₹797 ≈ ₹799",
